    "custom_assistant_Built-in rules": "内置规则",
    "custom_assistant_Every request goes to the models. Only the routines are still checked first.": "所有请求都交给模型。只有例程会先被检查。",
    "custom_assistant_Fixed rules understand switching, dimming and status of devices, timers, alarms, the time and the weather — in a few milliseconds, offline. What they do not understand goes on.": "固定规则可理解设备的开关、调光和状态，以及计时器、闹钟、时间和天气——只需几毫秒，离线运行。无法理解的请求会继续传递。",
    "custom_assistant_The adapter smart-text2command learns your phrasing from examples, runs only the actions you approved there and asks back when the room or the device is unclear. It understands German and English. Timers, alarms, the time and the weather stay with the built-in rules; what neither understands goes on.": "smart-text2command 适配器通过示例学习你的说法，只执行在其中批准的操作，并在房间或设备不明确时追问。它理解德语和英语。计时器、闹钟、时间和天气仍由内置规则处理；两者都无法理解的请求会继续传递。",
    "custom_assistant_smart-text2command instance": "smart-text2command 实例",
    "custom_assistant_Before this, %s routines are checked (tab Commands).": "在此之前会检查 %s 个例程（“命令”选项卡）。",
    "custom_assistant_Routines (fixed phrases with their own actions) are set up on the tab Commands.": "例程（带有自身操作的固定语句）在“命令”选项卡中设置。",
    "custom_assistant_Use a local LLM": "使用本地 LLM",
    "custom_assistant_The list of models needs the running instance.": "模型列表需要实例正在运行。",
    "custom_assistant_Ask before the cloud": "先于云端询问",
    "custom_assistant_Without a cloud step the local model is the last step.": "没有云端步骤时，本地模型是最后一步。",
    "custom_assistant_Every request the local decision does not understand goes to it first. Saves cloud calls, but on a Raspberry Pi it adds 10–25 seconds.": "本地判断无法理解的请求会先交给它。可减少云端调用，但在 Raspberry Pi 上会增加 10–25 秒。",
    "custom_assistant_It only answers when the cloud fails (offline, quota).": "仅在云端失败（离线、配额用尽）时回答。",
    "custom_assistant_Gives up after (s)": "超时放弃（秒）",
