    "custom_assistant_AI provider": "AI 提供商",
    "custom_assistant_Only the local steps answer; a request they do not understand gets a fixed sentence.": "仅由本地步骤回答；无法理解的请求会得到一句固定回复。",
    "custom_assistant_Provider": "提供商",
