    "custom_assistant_The API key and the other details are on the tab AI.": "API 密钥和其他详细信息在“AI”选项卡中。",
    "custom_assistant_The adapter pi-agent answers with its own model, tools and write permissions; every request source gets a conversation of its own there.": "pi-agent 适配器使用其自己的模型、工具和写入权限回答；每个请求来源在那里都有自己的对话。",
